The path rules. A name in a section line may be a Go string, to hold any bytes.
-- want --
error path-character "pages/C#.md"
error path-character "pages/Sub [draft]"
error path-nfc "pages/Ros\u0326u.md"
-- pages/C#.md --
-- "pages/Ros\u0326u.md" --
-- "pages/Ro\u0219u.md" --
NFC: no problem.
-- pages/Sub [draft]/inside.md --
A folder that breaks a rule is not read further.
